@startuml
title Состояния задачи TaskFlow
[*] --> TODO : create / сохранить
state "К выполнению" as TODO
state "В работе" as DOING
state "Готово" as DONE
TODO --> DOING : changeStatus(IN_PROGRESS)
DOING --> TODO : changeStatus(TODO)
DOING --> DONE : changeStatus(DONE) / [BR-08, BR-09]
TODO --> DONE : changeStatus(DONE) / [BR-08, BR-09]
DONE --> DOING : changeStatus(IN_PROGRESS)
DONE --> TODO : changeStatus(TODO)
TODO --> [*] : delete [confirmed]
DOING --> [*] : delete [confirmed]
DONE --> [*] : delete [confirmed]
note right of DONE
При первом переходе в DONE
с DAILY/WEEKLY создаётся
один новый Task в TODO.
end note
@enduml
